---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Orkun Külçe — blockchain technologist in the Cosmos ecosystem.">
  <div class="page page-header">
    <p class="back-link"><a href="/">← Home</a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="page page-body">
    <figure class="about-rose">
      <img src="/img/rose-bouquet.webp"
           alt="A bouquet of roses lit in electric blue and crimson" width="1200" height="1200"
           loading="eager">
    </figure>

    <h2><span class="hash">#</span>About</h2>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-sidebar">
        <span class="label">Name</span>
        <span class="value highlight">Orkun Külçe</span>
        <span class="label">Location</span>
        <span class="value">Turkey</span>
        <span class="label">Interests</span>
        <span class="value">Decentralized Systems<br>Regeneration<br>Non-dual Philosophy<br>Flow Art</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>
          I'm a blockchain technologist and metamodern mystic. Most of my
          work has been in the Cosmos ecosystem — smart contracts in Rust, including
          StreamSwap on Osmosis, and developer relations for CosmWasm. I breathe with
          decentralized systems and existences, and I'm interested in regeneration and
          non-dual philosophies and practices.
        </p>
        <p>
          I delved into Spanda and Pratyabhijñā teachings.
        </p>
        <p>
          I practice yoga, flow arts and movement.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr>

    <h3>Drive</h3>
    <p>
      I believe in unity of all being, and the rest is temporal illusion for the sake of
      play and joy. And technology is an expression of this uniting and playful urge.
    </p>

    <figure class="about-logo">
      <img src="/img/hermes-mark.webp" alt="Hermes emblem" width="1000" height="1000"
           loading="lazy">
    </figure>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
